WEBVTT

24:30.961 --> 24:32.002
It's Sid!

24:32.087 --> 24:33.838
Don't move!

24:33.922 --> 24:35.589
I thought he was at summer camp.

24:35.674 --> 24:37.758
They must've kicked him out
early this year.

24:38.260 --> 24:40.094
Oh, no, not Sid!

24:40.262 --> 24:41.762
Incoming!

24:43.765 --> 24:46.934
-Who is it this time?
-I... I can't... I can't tell.

24:47.018 --> 24:49.186
-Hey, where's Lenny?
-Right here, Woody.

24:49.271 --> 24:53.107
Oh, no, I can't bear to watch
one of these again.

24:53.191 --> 24:56.360
Oh, no, it's a Combat Carl.

24:56.445 --> 24:57.403
What's going on?

24:57.487 --> 25:01.198
Nothing that concerns you spacemen,
just us toys.
